# plugin/vendor/ holds the unmodified upstream release assets of the Obsidian
# plugins + theme the vault expects (#164), regenerated by
# scripts/refresh_vendor.py and never edited by hand.
#
# -text: never normalise line endings — the provisioner verifies these files
# byte-for-byte against the sha256 pins, and a CRLF checkout (Windows CI,
# a consultant laptop with core.autocrlf=true) would fail every pin.
# linguist-vendored/generated: GitHub collapses them in PR views and skips
# them in language stats. -diff on the big ones keeps a pin bump's diff
# readable — a 4.7 MB minified main.js is not reviewable line by line; the
# sha256 in plugin-pins.json is the review.
plugin/vendor/** -text linguist-vendored
plugin/vendor/**/*.js linguist-generated -diff
plugin/vendor/**/*.css linguist-generated -diff
